# --no-animation (reduced motion, TUI-DESIGN-3 §3.2 twins; replaces splash-reduced): the session mounts settled — frame 0 COMMITS the
# complete resting mark (5 `██` rows) as the first scrollback block and no frame ever carries the `▓▒░` head; the idle region is 6 rows (the
# rule and the console); a key still echoes
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
# raw mode on (Ink's post-commit effect writes ESC[?2004h): a key sent earlier is a cooked-mode byte the kernel echoes
expect \x1b\[\?2004h
sleep 0.1
send h
expect (?:›|>) (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*h
send \x03
expect Say hi
expect sess \$
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
